      "mergeID": "69d4f5e72b149944eeb5d552",
      "mergedPostDetails": "It would be very useful to have these properties sent as parameters, just like Phybone does.\n\nHaving the option to disable on miss is useful, but having a direct way to access that information through the animator, without needing contacts, is even better.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[SDK 3.10.3-beta.1] Send Distance and Miss via parameter on RayCast",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "69c7007a4cb35f2ec9d4f1bb",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
